  "testId": "testim-migrated/tests/webstore/checkout/detailed-validations-for-guest-user.spec.ts > Webstore - Checkout > detailed validations for guest user",
  "scenario": {
    "summary": "Guest adds a simple product (qty 2) from its PDP, checks out as guest with a Canada address and the Canada shipping method, checks the order-summary line (quantity, unit x qty = line total, Qty./Total/Shipping labels) and that Purchase Order, Invoice Me and COD are offered and unselected, then selects COD. No order is placed.",
    "steps": [
      "Open the webstore as a guest (empty storageState).",
      "Search the simple product SKU, open it, read the unit price (spnRetailPrice<productId>), set quantity 2 and add to cart.",
      "Open the cart, Checkout as Guest ('Proceed to Checkout'), fill the guest address (Canada) and select Ship Complete + CanadaShipping.",
      "Check the order-summary line: quantity, unit price x quantity = line total, Qty./Total labels, Remove link if present, Shipping label.",
      "Check the PurchaseOrder/InvoiceMe/COD payment labels are visible and all radios unchecked (Braintree CC if present), then select COD."
    ],
    "entitiesTouched": [
      "product",
      "store",
      "shipping",
      "payment",
      "cart"
    ],
    "stateChanges": [
      "Guest cart filled with the simple product (quantity 2)",
      "No order is placed"
    ],
    "assertions": [
      "'Proceed to Checkout' heading",
      "Line quantity equals data.quantity (2)",
      "Unit price > 0 and |unit x qty - line total| <= 0.05 (rounding tolerance)",
      "Qty. / Total / Shipping labels",
      "PurchaseOrder, InvoiceMe, COD payment labels visible; radios unchecked; COD checked after click"
    ],
    "evidence": [
      "Title 'detailed validations for guest user' and the three step labels match the flow; guest storageState.",
      "simpleProduct z-2200010 and productId 415: tda rows shows PimProductId 415, active SimpleProduct 'Speedaire Air Roofing Stapler'; PRODUCT_SIMPLE_IN_STOCK quantityUsed 2, outputs sku and productId (PimProductId).",
      "Profile (atstage 2026-10-31) has no observations for the checkout specs: every source is profiled false. Values were checked read-only with `tda rows` where noted.",
      "Store MaxwellsHardware: the store every migrated webstore spec runs on (as in the approved shopping-cart and PDP entries); not named in the scan.",
      "selectCOD/codRadio pays with COD (txtCOD): PAYMENT_COD_ON_STORE. No source carries the COD code the page object uses, so the need has no data source.",
      "MISSING KEY: the test needs the CanadaShipping custom shipping method on the store for a CA destination (page object selectCanadaShipping clicks lblShippingMethodCanadaShipping / #CanadaShipping-9). tda rows: CanadaShipping (ShippingId 9, Custom, DestinationCountryCode CA) has no shipping rule, so SHIPPING_FLAT_RATE_ON_STORE (needs a FlatRatePerItem rule) does not cover it. Need left out.",
      "MISSING KEY: Purchase Order and Invoice Me payment methods offered on the store to the guest (Anonymous) profile; no key covers them. Needs left out; the payment method codes (paymentMethods) are kept as config.",
      "Guest address fields (masked) are typed into the guest checkout: created-by-test.",
      "swap: data only through loadData (simpleProduct -> product.sku, productId -> product.productId), no derived assertions (unit price is read from the page; 0.05 is a rounding tolerance; labels are fixed UI text), no data value in the spec code (comments only), no other data file."
    ],
    "confidence": "low",
    "needsReview": true
  },
  "requires": [
    {
      "key": "PRODUCT_SIMPLE_IN_STOCK",
      "alias": "product",
      "params": {
        "quantityUsed": 2,
        "store": "MaxwellsHardware"
      },
